From 314404ea7449d840fc0a1d7765b4db0031eb730b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:04:32 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 103/230] Reserve a dedicated fixed slot for the A-ADS ad at
 the viewport bottom; modernize the design language with more breathing room
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add --space-page-x (16px) and --ad-slot-h (100px) to tokens.css
- Pin A-ADS iframe to a fixed bottom slot with reserved height
- Offset TabBar by --ad-slot-h so it sits above the ad
- Add bottom padding to AppShell main for TabBar + ad slot
- Add bottom padding to Login main for the ad slot (no TabBar)
- Update MatchDetail CTA bottom calc to include ad slot height
- Bump horizontal gutters from 12px to 16px across headers, cards, and pages
- Increase vertical spacing (pb-3→pb-4, mt-3→mt-4, etc.) for breathing room

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
